 she'd pose no real threat to the cozy relationship they maintain with Remus. Eager to prove them wrong, she dispatches her best investigator, Franklin Dodge, to look into his empire. It's a decision with deadly consequences: with Remus behind bars, Franklin and Imogene begin an affair and plot to ruin him, sparking a bitter feud that soon reaches the highest levels of government--and that can only end in murder.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Law, united states","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"nyt:hardcover-nonfiction=2019-08-25","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"New York Times bestseller","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Trials (murder)","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Murder, ohio","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Women, crimes against","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-pursued-him-and-the-murder-that-shocked-j"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Cincinnati (ohio), history","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-ghosts-of-eden-park-the-bootleg-king-the-women-who-purs